  "label": "Anti-Latino/Hispanic Stereotypes",
  "description": "The meme relies on the stereotype that Mexicans are undocumented migrants who illegally cross borders, often portrayed as 'on the run' or 'undocumented.' This stereotype is used to dehumanize and vilify a specific ethnic group, associating them with criminality and danger. It is a form of racialized xenophobia that frames migration as inherently illegal and threatening.",
